check 1
# Fire Blast past the Fallen: ScnAss (expansion, level 30, every skill at 20, right skill 251),
# -seed 1234; warp to the Blood Moor (level 2; variant
# blood-moor-empty: no monster population there) before frame 4, a Fallen
# (class 19) 4 sub-tiles away along +x (client pixel about 496, 296) before
# frame 10, then one right click at client pixel (544, 336), past the Fallen (+8, +1), before frame 20's
# drain (no hover on either side: d2rs' stand-in hover box,
# bridge::combat::hover_at, misses it). Compares the cast (mode, states, stats), its missiles' or
# summons' effects and the draws. Area F2 (q-diff-skills-2).
# Spec: specs/tools/scenario-diff.md.
name ass-fire-blast
save ScnAss --class ass --expansion --level 30 --all-skills 20 --right-skill 251
seed 1234
ticks 70
seconds 300
channels state
variant blood-moor-empty
at 4 poke warp 2
at 10 poke spawn 19 @x+4 @y normal
input frame 20; rclick 544 336
